# iBoot Droid: init.ibootdroid.rc for j171/j172 (iPad 7, T8010)
# The GSI system-as-root brings the standard init set (init.usb.rc,
# init.usb.configfs.rc, properties, servicemanager...). This file carries
# only what is device-specific. No stub HAL services yet: a service whose
# binary does not exist spams boot failures and lies in logs. Per-Milestone
# services land with their own binary requirements (android/README.md).

on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    # M3 floor: sys.boot_completed reached even with a black screen is a
    # pass, and this marker is the thing adb/logcat records.
    setprop vendor.ibootdroid.marker boot-completed
